=== Hard Mode ===
=== Nightmare Mode ===
=== Abysmal Mode ===
==Strategy==
*You can use Medic Cameraman or Camera Repair Drone to unstun units stunned by the Multi-Claw Jetpack Toilet.
*Use high DPS units to defeat this enemy.
==Trivia==
*This enemy is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Jetpack_Claw_Skibidi_Toilet Jetpack Claw Skibidi Toilet].
